      179.49,
      232.85,
      384.21,
      244.19
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE COMPANIES ACT, NO. 07 OF 2007",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      261.17,
      401.9,
      286.79
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      303.77,
      401.92,
      357.71
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Companies (Amendment)Act, No. of 2019 and shall come into operation on suchdate as the Minister may appoint by Order published inthe Gazette.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      374.81,
      401.92,
      471.35
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 427 of the Companies Act, No. 07 of 2007(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended in paragraph (a) of subsection (3) of that section,by the substitution for the words and figures \u201cthe provisionsof the Registration of Documents Ordinance (Chap. 117)\u201d,of the words and figures \u201cthe provisions of the SecuredTransactions Act, No. of 2019\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      488.33,
      401.88,
      513.95
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 428 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      530.93,
      401.9,
      641.75
    ],
    "text": "(1)in subsection (3) of that section, by the substitutionfor all the words and figures from \u201cregistered underthe Registration of Documents Ordinance(Chap. 117)\u201d to the end of that subsection, of thewords and figures \u201cregistered under the SecuredTransactions Act, No. of 2019 and the provisionsof that Act shall apply in regard to such floatingcharge.\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      658.73,
      384.6,
      670.07
    ],
    "text": "(2)by the repeal of subsection (4) of that section.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      305.35,
      447.58,
      333.62
    ],
    "text": "Short titleand date ofoperation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      376.15,
      451.29,
      423.62
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof section427 of Act,No. 07 of2007.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      490.15,
      451.29,
      537.62
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof section428 of theprincipalenactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      166.97,
      328.16,
      178.79
    ],
    "text": "2Companies (Amendment)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      203.45,
      397.2,
      240.11
    ],
    "text": "4.Section 431 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the addition immediately after subsection (6)of that section, of the following new subsection:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      193.15,
      254.21,
      397.19,
      329.03
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(7) Where any movable property owned by acompany is subject to a floating charge which isregistered under the Secured Transactions Act,No. of 2019, the provisions relating to prioritycontained in that Act shall apply in determiningthe priority of such floating charge.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      343.13,
      397.2,
      379.79
    ],
    "text": "5.The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 433 of the principal enactmentand shall have effect as section 433A of that enactment:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      393.89,
      397.18,
      443.27
    ],
    "text": "433A. In this Part of this Act, the term\u201cfloating charge\u201d means, a \u201csecurity right\u201d forthe purpose of the application of the provisionsof the Secured Transactions Act, No. of 2019.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      457.37,
      397.2,
      481.43
    ],
    "text": "6.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      459.95,
      451.11,
      497.61
    ],
    "text": "Sinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
